      "extracted_text": "Client name and contact information\nCompany Name *\nXpress Global Transport LLC\nFirst Name *\nKambuljon\nLast Name *\nKazakov\nBilling Address *\n3910 auburn blvd\nAddress Line 2\napt 11\nCity *\nSacramento\nState *\nCalifornia\nZip Code *\n95821\nPhone Number *\n6892554689\nBilling Email Address *\nglobaltransportation.2023@gmail.com\nT o d a y 's  D a te  *\n12 /2 0 /2 0 2 3\n\n    1  /  2    \nContractor name and contact information\nN a m e  *\nC u b e  S y s te m\nFUEL SAVINGS CLUB AGREEM ENT\nBank Account Name *\nXpress Global Transport LLC\nBank Account #: *\n953671075\nBank Name: *\nChase Bank\nRouting (ABA) #: *\n322271627\nUpload a voided check or bank screenshot showing Account and Routing numbers. *\nChoose FileNo file chosen\nACH Authorization Form\nI hereby authorize Cube System LLC to initiate electronic withdrawals from my account at\nthe financial institution named below. I also authorize Cube System LLC to make electronic\ndeposits into this account.\nFurther, I agree not to hold Cube System LLC responsible for any delay or loss of funds due\nto incorrect or incomplete information supplied by me or by my financial institution or due to\n f fi f\nACH Authorization Form\nI hereby authorize Cube System LLC to initiate electronic withdrawals from my account at\nthe financial institution named below. I also authorize Cube System LLC to make electronic\ndeposits into this account.\nFurther, I agree not to hold Cube System LLC responsible for any delay or loss of funds due\nto incorrect or incomplete information supplied by me or by my financial institution or due to\n f fi f\nTax ID: *\n92-3788177\nI, Kambuljon Kazakov, authorize Cube System to charge my credit card for agreed-upon\ncharges on fuel cards. I understand that my information will be saved to file for future\n\n    2  /  3    \nauthorized transactions on my account. \nCardholder's name *\nKambuljon Kazakov\nCredit/Debit Card Type *\nVisa\nBusiness Debit/Credit Card Number *\n4427427075813602\nCVV *\n135\nExpiration Date (mm/yy) *\n06/28\nUpload a card picture (Front Side) *\nChoose FileNo file chosen\nUpload a card picture (Back Side) *\nChoose FileNo file chosen\nELECTRONIC SIGNATURE\n1. Club M ember agrees to be bound by the terms of this Agreement upon the submission\nof Club M ember’s application and placement of Club M ember’s electronic signature\nbelow.\nI certify that I am authorized to enter into this Agreement on behalf of the Club M ember\nidentified herein, for whom I am signing below.\n \nBy signing below, I hereby acknowledge that I have completely read and fully understand this agreement, I\nalso affirm that the information provided is true and current. \nPersonal Guarantee Agreement\nI, Kambuljon Kazakov (Full name of Guarantor) herein referred to as “Guarantor” absolutely\nand unconditionally guarantees all obligations of Xpress Global Transport LLC to Club\nOrganizer pursuant to the Fuel Savings Club Agreement. The death or incompetence of the\n\nGuarantor shall not revoke this Guaranty. The. parties hereby knowingly, voluntarily, and\nintentionally waive the right either may have to a trial by jury in respect of any litigation based\nhereon, or arising out of, under or in connection with this Agreement and any agreement\ncontemplated to be executed in conjunction herewith, or any course of conduct, course of\ndealing, statements (whether verbal or written) or action of either party. This provision is a\nmaterial inducement for Club Organizer entering into this transaction with M ember. This\nGuaranty cannot be revoked. Without this Guaranty, Club Organizer would be unwilling to make\nthe Fuel Savings Club Agreement with the Club M ember.\n \nGuarantor executes this agreement in his or her individual capacity with the intent to be\npersonally liable for the obligations described herein.\nI. THE PARTIES\nThis Fuel Savings Club Agreement (the “Agreement”) is being made on 12/20/2023 between\n Cube System (the “Club Organizer”) and Xpress Global Transport LLC (Name of M ember).\nII. THE PARTIES’ INTENT\nClub M ember is a professional commercial driver or a business engaged in transportation\nand/or logistics services that desire to save money on fuel. Club Organizer is a company that\nnegotiates fuel discounts for its members with various fueling stations/outlets for a fee. It is\nthe intent of the Parties to this Agreement to enter a relationship wherein both Parties will\nbenefit financially from fuel purchase transactions.  \nIII. SERVICES PROVIDED BY THE CLUB ORGANIZER\n1. Club Organizer will negotiate fuel prices at a discounted rate on behalf of its members\nproviding savings on fuel to Club M embers ranging from $0.20 to $0.70 per gallon.\n2. The fuel discount rate is variable and subject to change daily.\n3. Club Organizer cannot provide a guarantee of any specific discount rate.\n4. Club Organizer will provide Club M ember with a list of participating fueling\nstations/outlets where Club M ember can obtain a discounted rate on fuel.\n5. Club Organizer will provide Club M ember with a Fuel Discount Club Card to use at the\ndesignated participating fueling stations/outlets.\n6. Club Organizer will invoice Club M embers twice per week (ex. Each M onday and\nThursday) \nIV. CLUB M EM BER’S DUTIES\n1. To obtain a discounted rate, Club M ember must charge the fuel purchase to the Fuel\nDiscount Club Card issued to Club M ember by Club Organizer at participating fueling\nstations/outlets designated by Club Organizer.\n2. Club M ember agrees to pay each invoice within 24 hours of receipt.\n3. Club M ember has the following options to pay invoices:\n1. Set up automatic payment allowing Club Organizer to charge Club M ember the full\namount of the invoice, each invoice period; or\n2. Pay manually each invoice period.\n4. If Club M ember does not pay each invoice in full within 24 hours of receipt, an annual\ninterest rate of 29.99% will apply to any unpaid balance.\n5. In case if client does not pay within 24 hours after receiving the invoice, they are agreed\nto pay 1.9% interest rate fee to Cube Systems LLC\n\n     6. Club Organizer reserves the right to stop providing Fuel Discount Club Card services if\nClub M ember does not pay invoices in full within 24 hours of receipt.\n \n \nV. AGREEM ENT NON-TRANSFERRABLE AND NON-ASSIGNABLE\n1. The Fuel Discount Club Card is not transferrable and may only be used by Club M embers.\nClub M ember is strictly responsible for safekeeping the card and preventing theft. Club\nM embers must notify Club Organizer immediately if the card is lost or stolen.\n2. Club M ember may not assign any rights or obligations under this Agreement to any other\nparty. \nVI.NOTICE BY ELECTRONIC M EANS\n1. Club M ember agrees to receive all notices, requests, demands, and other\ncommunications regarding this Agreement by electronic means only to the email\ndesignated by Club M ember in Club M ember’s application.\n2. Club M ember waives any right to receive paper notices, requests, demands, and other\ncommunications by mail.\n3. Club M ember must notify Club Organizer immediately of any change to Club M ember’s\nemail address.\nVII. PRIVACY POLICY\n1. Club Organizer will not use any data collected from Club M ember in relation to this\nAgreement for any purpose other than to provide services and enforce the terms of this\nAgreement.\n2. Club Organizer will take all reasonable steps to protect all confidential information\nprovided by Club M ember in the course of the Parties’ relationship pursuant to this\nAgreement.\n3. Club Organizer certifies that it will not sell any data provided by Club M ember in relation\nto this Agreement to any third party.\nVIII. DISPUTES\n1. This Agreement will be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the\nState of Florida. The Parties agree that the venue to enforce this Agreement is Orange\nCounty, Florida.\n2. The prevailing party to any dispute arising under this Agreement is entitled to reasonable\nattorney’s fees and costs from the losing party.\n3. In the event that Club M ember does not pay in full Club M ember’s outstanding balance\nand Club Organizer engages the services of the debt collection agency to enforce this\nAgreement, the cost of such services shall be due to Club Organizer by Club M ember.\n4. If a Club M ember fails to pay their invoice within 72 hours of receipt, the Club Organizer\nreserves the right to deactivate the M ember's cards until full payment is received. If the\nM ember fails to pay their invoice within 10 days of receipt, the Club Organizer may report\nthe outstanding debt to a collections agency.\n5. If a Club M ember incurs a debt to the Club Organizer, the Club Organizer reserves the\nright to suspend or revoke any and all discounts and privileges associated with Club\nM embership. In such cases, the discounted amount will not be deducted from the Club\nM ember's invoice.\n\nDriver License Number *\nK221500031420\nAdditional Phone Number *\nIn case of urgency\nBy signing below, I hereby acknowledge that I have completely read and fully understand this agreement, I\nalso affirm that the information provided is true and current. \nSIgnature *\nclear\nPowered by",
